      <div class="small muted">Last year's report is prepared every January. A transparent letter boosts credibility; spinning a bad year optimistically props up ${G.pub?'hisseyi':"investor interest"} in the short term but erodes trust. Credibility affects funding round valuations and board confidence.</div>
